    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 80 Viewmount Park is a spacious and versatile four-bedroom semi-detached residence extending to approximately 129 sq. metres (1,389 sq. ft.). Situated in one of Waterford City's most popular and established residential areas, this substantial family home offers three reception rooms, two bathrooms and a generous rear garden. The accommodation comprises an entrance porch, welcoming hallway, guest WC, a spacious principal living room and a second reception room adjoining the kitchen. The fitted kitchen provides ample storage and dining space, while a separate utility room offers additional practicality. The third reception room is particularly versatile and could serve as a comfortable family room, dedicated home office, playroom or, if required, a fifth bedroom at ground-floor level.\n\nAt first-floor level, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms and a modern family bathroom. The flexible arrangement of bedrooms and reception rooms makes the property especially suitable for a growing family, those working from home or purchasers seeking the convenience of potential ground-floor sleeping accommodation. The property benefits from gas-fired central heating with dual-panel radiators, PVC double-glazed windows and a BER rating of C. To the front is an imprinted concrete driveway providing generous off-street parking, together with a lawned garden and mature boundary planting.\n\nTo the rear is a sizable and private garden, predominantly laid in lawn and bordered by mature hedging and shrubs. A raised timber deck immediately adjoining the house provides an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining, while a paved patio area is positioned towards the end of the garden. A timber garden shed provides useful outdoor storage.\n\nViewmount Park enjoys an excellent location in Waterford City's highly sought-after eastern suburbs. University Hospital Waterford, Tesco Ardkeen and the Ardkeen Shopping Centre are all within easy reach, together with an extensive selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, pharmacies and medical services. The Dunmore Road area also offers numerous schools, sporting and leisure amenities, while regular bus services provide convenient access to Waterford City Centre. \n\nWith its generous accommodation, adaptable layout, excellent outdoor space and exceptionally convenient location, No. 80 Viewmount Park represents an attractive opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in one of Waterford's most desirable residential neighbourhoods.\n\n\nProperty Features:\n\nSpacious four-bedroom semi-detached residence\nApproximately 129 sq. metres (1,389 sq. ft.)\nThree versatile reception rooms\nThird reception room suitable as a home office or fifth bedroom\nFamily bathroom and ground-floor guest WC\nGas-fired central heating with dual-panel radiators\nPVC double-glazed windows\nBER rating: C\nImprinted concrete driveway with generous off-street parking\nSizable rear garden with lawn, paved patio and timber deck\nConvenient to University Hospital Waterford\nClose to Tesco Ardkeen and the Ardkeen Shopping Centre"
      },
